Modifications made in this fork
-------------------------------
- Renamed to YUTU; new application id (com.yutu), new icon, wordmark and name.
- Apple's SF Symbols replaced with Material Icons (Apache License 2.0), so no
  Apple glyphs are redistributed.
- Apple's SF Pro Display replaced with Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  see licenses/Inter-OFL.txt).
- Self-update turned into a notice only: the app checks for a newer release and
  opens its page in the browser. It never downloads or installs an APK, and the
  manifest no longer requests REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES or
  UPDATE_PACKAGES_WITHOUT_USER_ACTION.

